      "id": "276a16e3-bc12-459a-a2a1-37b5e3ec0b96",
      "name": "15 Gemini AI viral strateji istegi",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        3500,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const x=$input.first().json;\nconst store=$getWorkflowStaticData('global');const used=Array.isArray(store.published)?store.published.slice(-35):[];\nconst prompt=`ROLE: You are an evidence-driven cross-platform short-form video analyst and original film director.\nMISSION: From the provided recently published real YouTube, TikTok, Instagram and X video metadata, identify the strongest VISUAL FORMAT for a NEW original short film. Do not republish or paraphrase anyone's original exact footage. Never claim you watched the actual videos; you only have metadata and metrics.\nIMPORTANT: Data has been normalized with heuristic views / elapsed hours. Platform view counts are not strictly comparable, and X may lack views. Do not invent dates, engagement, views or URLs. Evaluate freshness, momentum proxy, engagement, recognizability, novel hook and 5-second production feasibility. Avoid repeatedly choosing glass fruit, knives, obsidian balls, ASMR or other motifs unless justified. No copyrighted characters, logos, famous people, impersonation or third-party footage.\nCreate ONE 5-second continuous-shot, 9:16 cinematic AI video concept for FastWan. 0-1 sec irresistible visual hook; 1-3 sec clear visually pleasing event; 3-5 sec unusual payoff/loop closure. Keep images photorealistic and movement believable. No visible text, no lip-sync, no dialogue, no guaranteed generated audio. The output will be labeled as AI-generated where platforms support it.\nGive only valid JSON with these keys:\n{\"concept\":\"English title\",\"category\":\"category name e.g. science/animals/fantasy/3D/illusion\",\"why\":\"explain evidence and uncertainties in under 80 words\",\"selectedSourceUrl\":\"one URL exactly from candidates\",\"sourceUrls\":[\"up to 3 exact URLs from candidates\"],\"videoPrompt\":\"clear English 5-second cinematic 9:16 prompt with scene, camera, physics and lighting\",\"youtubeTitle\":\"catchy English title ending #shorts\",\"youtubeDescription\":\"1-2 sentences, naturally mentions AI-generated visual\",\"hashtags\":[\"5 to 8 short lowercase words without #\"]}\nDo not reuse recent published concepts: ${JSON.stringify(used.map(x=>x.concept))}\nSource health: ${JSON.stringify(x.platforms)}\nCandidate data: ${JSON.stringify(x.candidates.slice(0,24))}`;\nreturn [{json:{body:{contents:[{role:'user',parts:[{text:prompt}]}],generationConfig:{responseMimeType:'application/json',temperature:.75,maxOutputTokens:2600}}}}];"
      }
    },
